{"chronology_summary":{"active_span":null,"created":null,"first_commit":null,"last_commit_or_push":null},"classification_summary":{"business_realm":null,"maturity":null,"portfolio_evidence_weight":null,"technical_realm":null},"concrete_signal_count":11,"document_id":"repo-119-rd002","document_schema_version":"2.0.0","embedding_text":"Repository: ImageProcessing\nRepository index: 119\nEvidence class: interpretation\nEvidence polarity: positive\nEvidence level: interpretive\nSemantic area: other_repository_evidence\nSource sections: What This Project Is, Repository Shape, MATLAB Live Script Artifact, Spatial Filtering Focus, Learning Workflow, Technical Stack\nTopics: - matlab, image-processing, spatial-filtering, shape, matlab, live, script, artifact, spatial, filtering, focus, learning, workflow, technical, stack\n\nRepository evidence:\nSection: What This Project Is\n\nImageProcessing is a compact MATLAB learning repository centered on spatial filtering.\n\nSpatial Filtering/\n\nspatialfilters.mlx\n\nThe Live Script is approximately 29 KB in the checked-in repository.\n\nThis is direct evidence of an interactive MATLAB notebook-style exercise devoted to spatial-filtering work.\n\nSection: Repository Shape\n\nThe repository has a deliberately small topic hierarchy.\n\nThe root README establishes the image-processing scope.\n\nThe subdirectory names the specific subject.\n\nThe .mlx artifact contains the executable/interactive MATLAB work.\n\nSection: MATLAB Live Script Artifact\n\n.mlx is MATLAB's Live Editor document format.\n\nThe checked-in file is a packaged Live Script rather than a plain .m source file.\n\nInspection of the container identifies MATLAB document/output entries such as:\n\nmatlab/document.xml\nmatlab/output.xml\n\nThat packaging is consistent with a Live Editor artifact that can combine executable MATLAB content with formatted explanatory material and captured output.\n\nThe portfolio evidence therefore includes use of MATLAB's notebook-like Live Script workflow.\n\nSection: Spatial Filtering Focus\n\nThe repository explicitly names its technical topic Spatial Filtering.\n\nSpatial filtering is part of digital image processing where local pixel neighborhoods are processed to transform an image.\n\nThe corpus uses the repository's explicit topic label as the evidence boundary.\n\nThe binary Live Script establishes that the topic was exercised interactively in MATLAB.\n\nSpecific filter kernels or mathematical operations are not inferred solely from the filename.\n\nSection: Learning Workflow\n\nThe repository structure reflects topic-oriented technical study.\n\nThe overall subject is separated at the root.\n\nA focused subtopic receives its own directory.\n\nThe practical work is placed in a Live Script.\n\nThis structure supports combining explanation, executable code, and visual output in one MATLAB learning artifact.\n\nSection: Technical Stack > MATLAB\n\nThe substantive artifact is a MATLAB Live Script.","embedding_word_count":335,"evidence_areas":["What This Project Is","Repository Shape","MATLAB Live Script Artifact","Spatial Filtering Focus","Learning Workflow","Technical Stack"],"evidence_level":"interpretive","evidence_polarity":"positive","provenance":{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-119-ImageProcessing/README.md","document_text_sha256":"ee6ccbb8e044a6ad76f98712b0302258382f4c92f06e68b58ba1da0ec760db04","earliest_source_line":20,"embedding_text_sha256":"14d7d7032208d31de89b7421b2feb5952f4f729f770fa045e610a5aa1a4fd721","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"7a5b731b371fb4d1a25fa0ec3b7fb945a483e0813c8011d217f06032d705e704","repository_source_line_end":147,"repository_source_line_start":1},"related_skill_ratings":[],"repository_index":119,"repository_name":"ImageProcessing","repository_slug":null,"repository_total":134,"repository_url":null,"retrieval_class":"interpretation","semantic_area":"other_repository_evidence","source_fragments":[{"block_id":"re